@model MyVoltage.Models.OperationalModels.AF_AfroxAdministration.AF_AfroxAdministrationModels.AF_AfroxAdministration_MeterReadingSummaryModel
@inject MyVoltage.Services.OperationalProvider operationalProvider;
@using MyVoltage.Extensions; 
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = $"{MyVoltage.Data.SecureAreaEnum.AF_AfroxAdministration_MeterReadingSummary.GetDescription()} - {operationalProvider.CompanyName}";
}
<div class="row mb-4">
    <div class="col">

        <div class="card p-md-1 mv-gradient">
            <div class="card-header">


            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                @if (operationalProvider.CompanyID > 0)
                {
                    <div class="row mb-md-2">
                        <div class="col-12">
                            <div class="row">
                                @*<div class="col">Completed Today: @Model.CompletedToday</div>
                                <div class="col">Left Today: @Model.LeftToday</div>*@
                                <div class="col">Total: @Model.Total</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row col-12">
                        <table class="table table-responsive-xl table-striped table-hover table-sm">
                            <tbody style="height:auto;">
                            <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <td>Serial</td>
                                    <td>Meter Point</td>
                                    <td>Customer Trading Name</td>
                                    <td>SAP Customer Acc No</td>
                                    <td>Occupancy Status</td>
                                    <td>Latest Live Reading</td>
                                    <td>Last Reading For @(DateTime.Now.AddMonths(-1).ToMonth())</td>
                                    <td>Last Reading For @(DateTime.Now.AddMonths(-2).ToMonth())</td>
                                    <td>Latest Audit Reading</td>
                                    <td>Latest Audit Reading Time</td>
                                    <td>Status</td>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                @foreach (var item in Model.AF_AfroxAdministration_MeterReadingSummaryItems)
                                {
                                    string rowclass = "";
                                    string cellClass = "";
                                    if (item.Status == MyVoltage.Data.A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MirrorReadingUpdate.StatusTypes.Unverified)
                                    {
                                        rowclass = " class=\"table-danger\"";
                                        cellClass = " class=\"text-red font-weight-bold\"";
                                    }
                                    else if (item.Status == MyVoltage.Data.A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MirrorReadingUpdate.StatusTypes.Deleted)
                                    {
                                        rowclass = " class=\"table-warning\"";
                                        cellClass = " class=\"text-orange font-weight-bold\"";
                                    }
                                    else if (item.Status == MyVoltage.Data.A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MirrorReadingUpdate.StatusTypes.Verified)
                                    {
                                        rowclass = " class=\"table-success\"";
                                        cellClass = " class=\"text-green font-weight-bold\"";
                                    }
                                    else if (item.Status == MyVoltage.Data.A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MirrorReadingUpdate.StatusTypes.NoAccess)
                                    {
                                        rowclass = " class=\"table-info\"";
                                        cellClass = " class=\"text-red font-weight-bold\"";
                                    }
                                    <tr @Html.Raw(rowclass) style="cursor:pointer;" title="View @item.Serial" onclick="RedirectToVerification('@item.Serial');">
                                        <td>@item.Serial</td>
                                        <td>@item.DeviceName</td>
                                        <td>@(item.CustomersDetail != null ? item.CustomersDetail.CustomerTradingName : "")</td>
                                        <td>@(item.CustomersDetail != null ? item.CustomersDetail.CustomerAccNo : "")</td>
                                        <td>@item.OccupancyStatus</td>
                                        <td class="text-right">@item.LatestReading.ToReading()</td>
                                        <td class="text-right">@(item.OneMonthAgo_DeviceReading != null ? item.OneMonthAgo_DeviceReading.VirtualOdometerReading.ToReading() : "")</td>
                                        <td class="text-right">@(item.TwoMonthAgo_DeviceReading != null ? item.TwoMonthAgo_DeviceReading.VirtualOdometerReading.ToReading() : "")</td>
                                        <td class="text-right">@item.LatestAuditReading.ToReading()</td>
                                        <td>@item.LatestAuditReadingTime.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm")</td>
                                        <td @Html.Raw(cellClass)>@item.Status.GetDescription()</td>
                                    </tr>
                                }
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                }
                else
                {
                    <div>Select a company to start...</div>
                }
            </div>
            <div class="card-footer">
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

@section Scripts {
    <script>
        function RedirectToVerification(serial) {
            document.location.href = '/operational/changeActiveMeter/' + serial + '?R=/operational/AF_AfroxAdministration/AF_AfroxAdministration_MeterReadingDetails';
        }
    </script>
}
